{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36973","headline":"芳树 · 罗隐","name":"芳树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细蕚慢逐风，暖香闲破鼻。\n青帝固有心，时时漏天意。\n去年高枝犹堕地，今年低枝已顦顇。\n吾所以见造化之权，变通之理。\n春夏作头，秋冬爲尾。\n循环反覆无终已，人生长短同一轨。\n若使威可以制，力可以止。\n则秦皇不肯敛手下沙丘，孟贲不合低头入蒿里。\n伊人强猛犹如此，顾我劳生何足恃。\n但顾我开素袍，倾绿蚁。\n陶陶兀兀大醉於清宵白昼间，任他上是天，下是地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}